    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_09",
      "hash64": "3942216C3477D40B",
      "text": "……走，我們到外面去。\\n希望沒有在下雪。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_010_koori_10",
      "hash64": "39459E6C347ADE49",
      "text": "人都到這裡來了，卻不辦正事……\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳這個人真有點奇怪。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
